		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi! You must be a tourist! I can\nSMELL it.\rTake a pic here! You saw the camera\noutside? I put it there! Illegally!\rYou might run into my family around.\nWe EVERYWHERE. Like pigeons.\rCheck the camera and it’ll take a\npic. A memory of your trip with your\fhomies!</language>
